# Cloudflare Pages response headers — hardening for the public civic board.
# Script CSP deliberately omitted: the boot JSON is an inline script whose
# hash changes every build; adding a hash requires a build-time _headers
# generator. Do NOT add 'unsafe-inline' script CSP — it buys false comfort.
# The CSP below only sets the directives that touch no script loading.
/*
  Content-Security-Policy: object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'; frame-ancestors 'none'; form-action 'self'; upgrade-insecure-requests
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), camera=(), microphone=(), payment=(), usb=(), interest-cohort=()
/service-worker.js
  Cache-Control: no-cache
/manifest.json
  Cache-Control: no-cache
